        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Perched gracefully upon a tranquil hill, this beautiful Gurudwara Sahib stands as a beacon of peace and devotion. The serene surroundings, combined with the warmth and love of the sangat, make it a sanctuary for the soul. We are truly blessed to have this sacred space so close to our home—an oasis of calm where prayer and reflection flow effortlessly amidst the divine stillness.",
        "time": 1727358649,
        "translated": false
      },
